    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T09:27:24Z",
    "body": "I'm not really sure how to solve this. I guess Fetch could say in \"basic fetch\" that this is otherwise known as \"about:blank\" or some such.\n\nOr maybe we should clarify some of the usage in HTML. E.g., it's unclear whether about:blank#test still matches about:blank. Same for about:blank?test. Fetch makes that clear and I believe user agents are divided on this.\n",
